{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":18.8},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.079,"end":42.4},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":43.92,"end":56.48}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":5.6,"text":"保留小型測試組：開放格子、強迫繞路、封閉終點。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.24,"end":11.96,"text":"每條回傳路徑都要檢查起終點、合法鄰接與避牆。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.4,"end":14.8,"text":"BFS 在這裡最小化步數；"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":15.36,"end":18.8,"text":"有權重地形需要其他最短路徑方法。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.079,"end":23.2,"text":"切換預設前先匯出自訂迷宮資料。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.84,"end":27.04,"text":"測試空白網格、有缺口的牆，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":27.2,"end":32.8,"text":"再封住第 7 列第 8 欄與第 8 列第 7 欄以隔離終點。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":33.52,"end":37.28,"text":"說明不等通行成本為何需要其他演算法。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":38.48,"end":39.44,"text":"什麼條件下，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":39.56,"end":42.4,"text":"BFS 保證最小化這條路的成本？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":43.92,"end":44.8,"text":"什麼條件下，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.96,"end":48.08,"text":"BFS 保證最小化這條路的成本？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":49.439,"end":53.04,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":53.84,"end":56.48,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}